6. Important Observation
In CSRF attacks:

Attacker cannot read the response
This is different from XSS.
CSRF is about:

Executing actions
NOT stealing data
Examples of CSRF impact:

Change password
Transfer money
Update email
Add admin user
Delete account
Modify profile
Purchase products
Any state-changing operation can be targeted.


